{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1000_035hin", "source_sha256": "8ef7ba72ec83eb01a710bceddf28a2a0fa9263015a68eedf0542213847d37b6e", "ja": "{$P$}、思ったんだけども。\n赤ずきんって、良い子だねぇ。", "zh": "{$P$}，我觉得啊，\n小红帽真是个好孩子呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "162f3b10e0f01a529902e1103f8c8d2ca6bc8d8f392252ff4fa5bf01a8d090b9", "ja": "ばあちゃんの具合が悪いもんで、毎日、\n森の奥までパンを届けに行ってるんだもの。", "zh": "她每天都为了身体不好的奶奶，\n送面包到森林深处给奶奶耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "f41fdce91ba0a9f9f9ace03dc5c94c88670443c6a3b351aa074f0f7d5c171385", "ja": "健気だなぁって、感心してしまったんだわ。\nあたしも、赤ずきんを見習おうと思ったよぉ。", "zh": "我真的觉得她好伟大，好佩服她喔。\n我觉得自己也该效仿小红帽的精神哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1003_p", "source_sha256": "054cb469f1c57c3a671bad305d94113a405af1ba107dc4745c1c4f3df072130a", "ja": "赤ずきんを見習う……か。\nひなたらしい発想だな。", "zh": "效仿小红帽的精神……吗？\n这个点子真有日向的特色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4a2944a1bbd98af6a89f043725a6916f74e5825f1e82d9acea59023625e94ba8", "ja": "でも、ひなたも同じくらい良い子だと思うぞ？\nおばあちゃん想いのところなんか、そっくりだ。", "zh": "不过，我觉得日向也不遑多让喔。\n你们都一样很替奶奶着想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "e025644e1e776ba781b5beced3822faa1b1c6f03502e941e227f1aaf3b0808bd", "ja": "えへへ……。{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……真高兴听到{$P$}\n这么说呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "961960d6a3aebfc7062e0449aedb4b987b07892a442f5c9a69f269fc537d7f78", "ja": "でも、うちのばあちゃんは元気だよぉ。\n毎日、畑に出てっからねぇ。", "zh": "可是，我的奶奶健康得很哪。\n每天都还下田干活呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1007_p", "source_sha256": "38f8521877d76db45aec63ca128f5ba16b6f68799f8b79335c862bc192479ea0", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。それじゃあ、ひなたは\nパンの代わりに歌とダンスを届けてあげよう。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n那么，日向就用歌声和舞蹈来替代面包吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1a979bdc957a329989708449a19b84d818d2e6722e5835e2df15977b525b05d4", "ja": "アイドルとして活躍しているひなたの姿は、\nおばあちゃんにとって何よりのプレゼントだと思うぞ！", "zh": "我想日向做为偶像的活跃表现，\n对奶奶而言就是最棒的礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "1caac5b5f854f94785c1eaae3c1331a553c0e40c55b61b8fef579390aa8b70b4", "ja": "はぁ～、なるほど。\n{$P$}の言うとおりだべさ。", "zh": "哦～原来如此。\n{$P$}说得没错哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0092_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "2f8eb6297831e90b8b38d828da0d199c561f80844c3e9d38483678031d81ab67", "ja": "今のあたしにできる、一番のばあちゃん孝行で。\nアイドルのお仕事、がんばるねぇ。", "zh": "我现在最能孝顺奶奶的方式，\n就是好好做偶像的工作哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
